    "description": "Regenerate the current user's recovery codes, invalidating the entire previous set. Re-auth is a\n  fresh second factor — a TOTP code or an unused recovery code — so a stolen password alone can\n  never rotate the codes. The plaintext codes are returned exactly once; only hashes are stored.",
    "operationId": "post-api-ee-mfa-recovery-codes",
    "parameters": [],
